flowchart TB
    Internet((Internet)) --> Route53[Route 53]
    Route53 --> CloudFront[CloudFront]
    CloudFront --> WAF[AWS WAF]
    WAF --> ALB[Application Load Balancer]

    subgraph VPC[AWS VPC]
        subgraph ECS[Private ECS Fargate services]
            Auth[auth-service]
            Orders[orders-service]
            Notifications[notifications-service]
            CloudMap[Cloud Map service discovery]
        end
        RDS[(RDS PostgreSQL)]
        ElastiCache[(ElastiCache Redis)]
    end

    ALB --> Auth
    ALB --> Orders
    ALB --> Notifications
    Orders --> CloudMap
    CloudMap --> Notifications
    Auth --> RDS
    Orders --> RDS
    Orders --> ElastiCache
    Notifications --> RDS

    Secrets[Secrets Manager + KMS] -.-> ECS
    Logs[CloudWatch Logs] -.-> ECS
    Audit[CloudTrail / GuardDuty / Security Hub] -.-> VPC
